{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Lite</strong> is a nostalgic, fun, and simple experience without appealing overstimulation, featuring minimalist and retro art inspired by old games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935250/extras/8da2a58b682c0d8c898ab933f068dceb.avif?t=1766109801\" width=1560 height=731 /></span>With only 5 spaces on the battlefield, you need to create a strategy to deal a good damage while still defending yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identical cards can be merged to form a stronger spell, optimizing available spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935250/extras/63ff4c6ddd8082cc43de1821a99221c0.avif?t=1766109801\" width=1439 height=918 /></span>The <strong>FORGE</strong> is where spells are permanently merged, adding a more powerful card to your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935250/extras/ef4fe596b16b51103a3564ded2051799.avif?t=1766109801\" width=1560 height=1003 /></span>Permanent <strong>UPGRADES</strong> allow you to advance even further in matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card types:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack:</strong> Activated when placed on the battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense:</strong> Shield cards to defend your field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elementals:</strong> Creatures that defend you but also attack at the end of the turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus:</strong> Makes spells even stronger by adding more damage or defense</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935250?t=1766109801","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935250/d5730c8235177ef7f113a8158ec96220233465b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766109801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935250/de109ea9d9870bb1ec98709312a5822de0ffe6ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766109801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935250/de109ea9d9870bb1ec98709312a5822de0ffe6ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766109801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Lite</strong> is a nostalgic, fun, and simple experience without appealing overstimulation, featuring minimalist and retro art inspired by old games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935250/extras/8da2a58b682c0d8c898ab933f068dceb.avif?t=1766109801\" width=1560 height=731 /></span>With only 5 spaces on the battlefield, you need to create a strategy to deal a good damage while still defending yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identical cards can be merged to form a stronger spell, optimizing available spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 